#     Description | pvalue | p.adjust | qvalue | Count
# Terms are ranked by RAW pvalue (ascending) within each direction, pulled from
# the FULL tested table in each saved enrichResult's @result slot (no rerun).
#
# Every pair is represented. A direction with no stored object / no tested terms
# (e.g. skipped for too few genes) is marked "no terms tested" with blank stats.
#
# IMPORTANT framing: these are DESCRIPTIVE. p.adjust/qvalue are included so the
# (generally non-FDR-significant) strength is transparent in the supplement.
# =============================================================================
suppressPackageStartupMessages({
